meta {
  name: Members - Leave
  type: http
  seq: 128
}

delete {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/communities/nswswk8w8wso0ko8owwk8k0w/membership
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  The current member leaves the community (#1338). They leave its access groups and lose their course progress. What they wrote stays, and they lose the rights on it. Returns 204. The owner gets a 422 (transfer the ownership first, or delete the community); a user who is not a member gets a 403.
}
